        },
        "step_ipFTmc": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2023",
            "text": "In 2023, Fitness Superstore Inc. opened a second warehouse in Benicia, spanning 40,000 sq ft, which includes a 4,400 sq ft showroom primarily showcasing our renowned, homegrown French Fitness brand. With this addition, we now have two Benicia warehouses, totaling 63,500 sq ft, scaling up our operations."
